:: encounter.alley-mugging-approach -> @exit
  @auto enter-place
  @place-key alleyway
  @when not flags.encounter.alley_mugging_seen

  @onenter
    @effect set flags.encounter.alley_mugging_seen
  @endonenter

  A stranger steps into your path and demands your money.

  @choicegroup ""

    @choice "No way!" -> encounter.alley-mugging
      @response
        You refuse to hand over your money. The mugger steps closer, and the confrontation becomes physical.
      @endresponse
    @endchoice
  @endchoicegroup

  @choice "Hand over up to £20" -> @exit
    @effect take-money up-to 20
    @response
      You hand over what the mugger demands. Once they have the money, they let you return to the street.
    @endresponse
  @endchoice

  @choice "Run for the street"
    @check skill fitness easy
    @success -> @leave-place
      @response
        You manage to outrun the mugger and make it safely back to the street.
      @endresponse
    @endsuccess
    @failure -> encounter.alley-mugging
      @response
        The mugger catches you before you can reach the street. You turn to face them as the confrontation becomes physical.
      @endresponse
    @endfailure
  @endchoice

:: encounter.alley-mugging -> @exit
  @actor mugger civilian

  @system encounter.physical {"scenario":"fight","opponent":{"id":"mugger","actor":"mugger"},"goal":{"id":"steal-money","maxAmount":20},"outcomes":{"player-rescued":"encounter.alley-mugging-rescue"}}

:: encounter.alley-mugging-rescue -> @exit
  @actor rescuer civilian

  Your scream carries beyond the alley. A nearby {{actor.rescuer.noun}} rushes toward you, shouting that help is coming.

  The interruption is enough. The mugger releases you and runs before {{actor.rescuer.subject}} can reach the fight. Once the attacker is gone, the {{actor.rescuer.noun}} stays with you and makes sure you are safe.
